 "insight": [
  "The share of the top 3 export products of Luxembourg decreased from 2005 to 2025.",
  "In 2005, machinery and mechanical appliances made up 26.8%, electrical machinery and equipment 21.0%, and iron and steel 11.2% of exports.",
  "By 2025, these shares fell to 12.5%, 9.3%, and 6.9% respectively.",
  "The largest decline was in electrical machinery and equipment exports, which dropped by 55.9% over the period.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
